 "_comment": "Test vector of the 'same client connection' key of the audit search (audit_search.connection_groups): audit records (auditData) in, groups out. A record joins a group when it has the group's record type (as text, trimmed), actor (whitespace collapsed, case folded), server (OriginatingServer without its build suffix in parentheses, case folded) and client address with its port (ClientIP, case folded), and its CreationTime is at most window_seconds after the previous record of the group; otherwise it starts a group of its own. A record with no server, no actor, no time or a client address without a port is in no group. Each group lists record Ids oldest first (ties by Id), and the groups are ordered by their first record. Every value is invented.",
